          "confidence": 0.9,
          "synopsis": "Chapter 6 Contracts › LEARNING OBJECTIVES: 1. Find out when the Uniform Commercial Code (UCC) is the appropriate law to apply and when the common law is the appropriate law. 2. Learn the elements of common-law contracts. 3. Identify the difference between common-law contracts and contracts between merchants. A contract is a legally enforceable promise.",
