          "synopsis": "Chapter 6 Contracts › Hyperlink: Coach Mike Leach › 152: defenses include formation problems, lack of capacity, illegality of subject matter, impossibility, duress, unconscionability, undue influence, violation of the Statute of Frauds requirement that certain types of contracts must be in writing to be enforceable against the defendant, exceeding the statute of limitations, mistake, misrepresentation, fraud, commercial impracticability, andfrustration of purpose.",
